<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Dashboard Siswa — FRExam</title><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><style>:root{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;color:#1f2937}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f5f7fa}.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:32px 22px}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:#23395d;font-size:22px;font-weight:800}.cap{width:38px;height:38px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:12px;background:#e8eef7}.muted{color:#64748b}.out{border:0;background:#fff;color:#64748b;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 3px 10px #17203310;cursor:pointer}.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(115deg,#23395d,#365d92);color:#fff;padding:31px;border-radius:22px;margin-top:26px}.hero:after,.hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;border-radius:50%;background:#ffffff14}.hero:after{width:240px;height:240px;right:-65px;top:-120px}.hero:before{width:120px;height:120px;right:135px;bottom:-70px}.hero h1{margin:0;font-size:28px}.hero p{max-width:560px;color:#e7effa;line-height:1.65}.start{position:relative;z-index:1;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#fff;color:#23395d;text-decoration:none;padding:13px 17px;border-radius:11px;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;box-shadow:0 8px 18px #1720332b}.tip{margin-top:23px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.tip article{background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:17px;border:1px solid #eef2f7}.tip b{display:block;color:#23395d;margin-bottom:6px}.tip p{margin:0;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5}.history{margin-top:22px;background:#fff;padding:23px;border:1px solid #eef2f7;border-radius:17px;box-shadow:0 3px 12px #17203309}.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.head h2{margin:0;font-size:19px}.badge{font-size:12px;color:#365d92;background:#e8eef7;padding:6px 9px;border-radius:20px}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:16px}th{color:#64748b;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px}th,td{padding:13px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2f7;text-align:left}.score{font-weight:800;color:#23395d}.status{font-size:12px;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:20px;background:#e8eef7;color:#365d92}.pending{background:#f1f5f9;color:#64748b}@media(max-width:680px){.top{align-items:flex-start}.tip{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{padding:25px}.hero h1{font-size:24px}table{font-size:12px}.history{overflow:auto}}</style></head><body><main class="wrap"><header class="top"><div class="brand"><i class="cap">🎓</i>FRExam</div><form method="post" action="{{ route('logout') }}">@csrf<button class="out">Keluar ↪</button></form></header><section class="hero"><p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:13px">Dashboard Siswa</p><h1>Halo, {{ $user->name }}! Siap belajar? ✨</h1><p>Masukkan token dari guru saat Anda siap memulai. Seluruh hasil ujian akan tersimpan rapi di dashboard ini.</p><a class="start" href="{{ route('student.token') }}">✦ Mulai Mengerjakan Ujian</a></section><section class="tip"><article><b>① Masukkan Token</b><p>Gunakan token yang dibagikan guru untuk membuka ujian yang sesuai.</p></article><article><b>② Kerjakan dengan Fokus</b><p>Pastikan koneksi stabil dan jangan berpindah tab saat ujian berlangsung.</p></article><article><b>③ Lihat Hasil</b><p>Nilai dan riwayat ujian Anda akan otomatis tampil di bawah ini.</p></article></section><section class="history"><header class="head"><h2>Riwayat Ujian</h2><span class="badge">{{ $attempts->count() }} aktivitas</span></header><table><thead><tr><th>Ujian</th><th>Mata Pelajaran</th><th>Status</th><th>Nilai</th><th>Tanggal</th></tr></thead><tbody>@forelse($attempts as $attempt)<tr><td><strong>{{ $attempt->title }}</strong></td><td>{{ $attempt->subject }}</td><td><span class="status {{ $attempt->status !== 'submitted' ? 'pending' : '' }}">{{ $attempt->status === 'submitted' ? 'Selesai' : 'Belum selesai' }}</span></td><td class="score">{{ $attempt->status === 'submitted' ? $attempt->score : '—' }}</td><td>{{ $attempt->submitted_at ?? $attempt->started_at }}</td></tr>@empty<tr><td colspan="5" class="muted" style="text-align:center;padding:32px">Belum ada riwayat ujian. Yuk, mulai ujian pertamamu!</td></tr>@endforelse</tbody></table></section></main></body></html>
